When enemy dies, model group hidden so marker hidden automatically; but on respawn, model visible and marker may still be visible if event active and target dead? For bounty target dead -> event completed and clear; for takedown dead -> clear mark for that enemy. Good. But on respawn, `e.marker` may still visible if event active target? If dead, we don't complete until killEnemy; clear after kill. Good.
When event fails, clear all.

`killEnemy(e)` currently sets dead, visible false, rewards, toast. Add after reward:
```
if (streetEvent.active) {
 if (streetEvent.type==='bounty' && streetEvent.target===e) completeStreetEvent('bounty');
 else if (streetEvent.type==='takedown' && streetEvent.targets.includes(e)) {
   e.marker.visible=false;
   streetEvent.progress++;
   if (streetEvent.progress>=streetEvent.goal) completeStreetEvent('takedown');
   else { showToast('MARKED RUNNER DOWN · '+progress+' / '+goal, 'good'); updateEventHUD(); }
 }
}
```
Careful: killEnemy uses `showToast('BOUNTY DOWN · +$...')` then event completion toast might replace. Fine. Maybe event completion reward occurs in completeStreetEvent; its toast says STREET OP COMPLETE. Good.

When a marked enemy is killed for takedown, the normal bounty toast plus event toast; maybe okay. Could suppress normals? No.

`updateStreetEvents(dt)`:
```
if (!campaignComplete) return;
if (!streetEvent.active) {
  if (mode === 'interior') return;
  eventCooldown -= dt;
  if (eventCooldown <= 0) spawnStreetEvent();
  return;
}
const ev = streetEvent;
ev.timer -= dt;
animate marker/beacon
if (ev.type==='bounty' && ev.target && !ev.target.dead) { ... marker pulse } 
if (ev.type==='takedown') ... pulse
if (ev.type==='drop'||'checkpoint') {
  // beacon pulses
  if (mode !== 'interior' && dist2(player...) < (ev.type==='drop'?2.8:4.5)) completeStreetEvent();
}
if (ev.timer <=0) failStreetEvent();
```
But updateStreetEvents is called from updateWorld after updatePackages? We'll call. Should event timer tick while driving? yes, mode street/vehicle. While shop open updateWorld skipped, so paused. While interior skip? We can still tick? maybe pause. We'll call only when mode !== 'interior'. Better update timers while interior? It could expire while shopping; pause is fair. `updateStreetEvents` called in updateWorld, but updateWorld also runs interior branch; add guard inside.
- The event beacon is child of world; when interior world hidden, fine.
- Event panel still display; could remain but timer frozen. okay.

`spawnStreetEvent`:
```
function spawnStreetEvent() {
  if (streetEvent.active || !campaignComplete) return;
  const alive = enemies.filter(e=>!e.dead);
  let type = ['bounty','takedown','drop','checkpoint'][Math.floor(Math.random()*4)];
  if ((type==='bounty'||type==='takedown') && alive.length < (type==='takedown'?3:1)) type='drop';
  if (type==='takedown' && alive.length<3) type='bounty' ...
```
Maybe choose only from types available.
- For location events, choose spot:
```
const candidates = EVENT_SPOTS.filter(s => dist2(player.x,player.z,s.x,s.z) > 45 && !blockedAt(s.x,s.z,.4));
const spot = candidates.length ? candidates[Math.floor(Math.random()*candidates.length)] : EVENT_SPOTS[0];
```
- Event object:
```
streetEvent.active=true; type; timer=duration; duration; progress=0; targets=[]; target=null; x=spot.x;...
```
- For bounty:
  - candidates = alive.filter(d>30); target random or farthest. `target = ...`
  - `markEnemy(target)`; `streetEvent.target = target`; name "BOUNTY MARK"; copy "A marked runner is loose in the district. Take them down before the clock runs out."; reward `500+job*40`; xp `55+job*5`; duration 95; goal1.
  - Maybe set target.alert=999? no.
  - We might want a beacon over target as described; marker.
  - `streetEvent.x/z` unused.
- Takedown:
  - choose 3 random alive enemies (maybe nearest within? choose shuffled)
  - mark each; name "SHAKEDOWN"; copy "Three marked runners are working the district. Drop all three."; reward 750+job*50, xp 90+job*8; duration 120.
  - Could be hard to find; markers + minimap show.
- Drop:
  - event beacon at spot, color gold; name "DEAD DROP"; copy "A supply cache is exposed nearby. Grab it before the window closes."; reward 400+job*30; xp 45+job*5; duration 75.
- Checkpoint:
  - name "EXTRACTION WINDOW"; copy "A clean exit is open. Reach the marked point before it shuts."; reward 450+job*35; xp 55+job*6; duration 55.
- Show panel and toast:
```
showToast('STREET OP · ' + name, 'good');
sfx.respawn? maybe pickup;
updateHUD(true);
```
Need not start multiple events.
- For the location beacon, use `streetBeacon` visible; set position; maybe color? one gold.
- For enemy events, hide beacon.
- For the HUD event color maybe use description.

`completeStreetEvent()`:
```
const ev = streetEvent; if (!ev.active) return;
const x = (ev.target ? ev.target.x : ev.x), z = ...
addCash(ev.reward); gainXP(ev.xp);
player.kills? no, normal kill counts.
burst(x,1.2,z,'#ffc35e',22,6);
sfx.win(); showToast('STREET OP COMPLETE · +$'+reward+' · +'+xp+' XP','good');
cleanupStreetEvent(); eventCooldown = 22 + Math.random()*22;
updateHUD(true);
```
For takedown target dead, last killed location maybe use last target; store on kill. Pass x,z into complete? Could use player.x,z. Fine. For location events use ev.x/z. For bounty use target.x/z (after killed, still position). Good.
- cleanup:
```
streetEvent.active=false;
streetBeacon.visible=false;
clearEnemyMarks();
el.eventPanel.classList.remove('on');
```
- Fail:
```
showToast('STREET OP EXPIRED · ' + ev.name, 'bad'); sfx.deny(); cleanup...
```
- Do not reset eventCooldown to 0. initial after free roam set 8.

Need event HUD update. In `updateHUD`:
```
if (streetEvent.active) {
 el.eventPanel.classList.add('on');
 el.eventLabel.textContent = 'STREET OP / FREE ROAM';
 el.eventName.textContent = streetEvent.name;
 el.eventCopy.textContent = streetEvent.desc;
 el.eventProgress.textContent = type...;
 el.eventTimer.textContent = format...
 el.eventBar.style.width = ((streetEvent.timer/streetEvent.duration)*100)+'%';
} else el.eventPanel.classList.remove('on');
```
Need include element refs. `updateHUD` called at 0.08s, timer update fine.

Progress display:
- bounty: `TARGET ACTIVE`, timer.
- takedown: `progress / goal`.
- drop/checkpoint: distance to point.
Maybe `eventProgress` text plus timer.

Panel markup inside left-stack after vitals:
```
<div id="event-panel" class="panel event-panel">
 <div class="eyebrow" id="event-label">STREET OP / FREE ROAM</div>
 <div class="event-name" id="event-name"></div>
 <div class="event-copy" id="event-copy"></div>
 <div class="progress-row"><span id="event-progress">...</span><span id="event-timer">0:00</span></div>
 <div class="progress-track"><div id="event-bar" class="progress-fill event-fill" style="width:100%"></div></div>
</div>
```
